            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"4-a-refusal-names-its-exit\">4. A refusal names its exit</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">An engine runs only what Lean can say it computes. Ask for a plan it\ncan't run, and Sverify says what to do. We number each\ncustomer's lines, with no order stated:</span></span>"
