            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Spark's window functions need an <code>ORDER BY</code> here, and the plan states\nnone. The message offers one exit: <code>engine='duckdb'</code> runs the plan on\nthe engine that numbers rows without one, in the order it happens to\nfind them:</span></span>"
